<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">1. Introduction</h2>
<p>Hello Transport respects your privacy and is committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you visit <a class="ht-pp-link" href="https://hellotransport.com">https://hellotransport.com</a> or use our vehicle shipping and auto transport services.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">2. Information We Collect</h2>
<p>We may collect your name, email address, phone number, vehicle details, pickup and delivery locations, shipping information, and payment details when applicable. We may also collect technical information about your device and website activity.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
<p>We use your information to provide vehicle shipping quotes, manage bookings, coordinate transportation, process payments, respond to inquiries, improve our services, and meet applicable legal obligations.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">4. Website Usage and Analytics</h2>
<p>We may collect information about how visitors use our website, including pages viewed, browser type, IP address, and browsing activity. This information helps us identify technical issues and improve website performance.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">5. Cookies and Tracking Technologies</h2>
<p>Hello Transport may use cookies and similar technologies to remember preferences, analyze website traffic, and improve functionality. You can manage or disable cookies through your browser settings, although some website features may be affected.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">6. Customer Communication</h2>
<p>We may use your contact details to provide quotes, confirm bookings, coordinate pickup and delivery schedules, and send shipment updates. Promotional communications may be sent where permitted by law and with any required consent. You may opt out of marketing messages at any time.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">7. Third-Party Information Sharing</h2>
<p>We do not sell or rent your personal information. We may share relevant information with carriers, drivers, logistics partners, payment processors, and service providers when necessary to fulfill your transportation requests. Information may also be disclosed when required by law or to protect our legal rights.</p>
<p><b>Mobile Privacy:</b> No mobile information will be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional purposes. Text messaging opt-in data and consent will not be shared with third parties.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">8. Payment and Transaction Information</h2>
<p>When you make a payment for our services, relevant transaction and billing information may be processed to complete the payment and maintain business records. Payment information is handled according to the procedures of the applicable payment provider.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">9. Data Security</h2>
<p>We use reasonable administrative and technical safeguards to protect personal information against unauthorized access, loss, misuse, alteration, or disclosure. However, no online transmission or electronic storage method can guarantee absolute security.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">10. Data Retention</h2>
<p>We retain personal information for as long as reasonably necessary to provide our services, manage transportation records, resolve disputes, and meet legal or regulatory obligations. Retention periods may vary depending on the type of information and its purpose.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">11. Your Privacy Rights and Policy Updates</h2>
<p>Depending on applicable law, you may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information. You may also withdraw consent where applicable or opt out of promotional communications.</p>
<p>We may update this Privacy Policy to reflect changes in our services, business practices, or legal requirements. We encourage you to review this page periodically for updates.</p>

<h2 class="ht-section-title-2">12. Third-Party Websites and Contact Information</h2>
<p>Our website may contain links to external websites that operate under their own privacy policies. Hello Transport is not responsible for the privacy practices of independent third-party websites.</p>
<p>For questions about this Privacy Policy or your personal information, contact us:</p>
